<Information title="About" description="About information for Why Elixir?.">
<p>Why Elixir? is an introductory reference website from Optimum Tech. It explains reasons to consider Elixir and points readers toward the language, community and ecosystem. The page discusses software concerns such as concurrency, scalability and maintainability alongside examples of areas where Elixir can be used.</p>
<p>Use the site as a starting point for evaluating Elixir in the context of a project. It does not replace the official language documentation, library documentation or a project-specific technical assessment. Follow the referenced primary resources for installation, API details and supported versions. Optimum Tech’s company website owns its current consulting offer.</p>
</Information>
